config MAX3010X_PPG
	bool "MAX3010x PPG sensor (unified driver for MAX30101/02/05)"
	default y
	depends on I2C && SENSOR
	help
	  Unified MAX3010x pulse oximeter/heart-rate sensor driver supporting:
	    - MAX30101: 3 LEDs (Red + IR + Green)
	    - MAX30102: 2 LEDs (Red + IR only)
	    - MAX30105: 3 LEDs (Red + IR + Green, particle sensor variant)

	  The variant is determined by the device tree compatible string:
	    "maxim,max30101-ppg" for MAX30101
	    "maxim,max30102-ppg" for MAX30102
	    "maxim,max30105-ppg" for MAX30105

	  Features:
	  - Proper FIFO drain (reads all available samples per fetch)
	  - Runtime LED current configuration via sensor_attr_set()
	  - Shutdown/wakeup power management via sensor API
	  - FIFO overflow detection and recovery
	  - Returns -EAGAIN when no new data available
	  - Auto-clamps Green LED settings for MAX30102 (2-LED variant)
